# Whole-screen messages (wip199): a warning (warn()) and a question (CHANGE PRESET?) take the whole 240 x 240
# screen: no header, no knob row, no legend; a plain confirmation (say) stays in the header. The shots are to be
# looked at (build/scenarios/fullscreen/*.png); the expects only check that the screens come and go.
wait 300
expect view 7
# nothing copied yet: a warning, the whole screen for about 1.8 s, then the SEQ page again
key b10 down
tapkey b9
key b10 up
wait 100
shot warn_full.png
wait 2500
expect view 7
shot warn_gone.png
# the PRESETS knob: the question, the whole screen, the preset big and purple; OCT- goes back
turn PRESET 1
wait 100
shot ask_full.png
tap OCT-
wait 100
expect view 7
shot ask_gone.png
